    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe concrete implementation of <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_r_a_g_context_budget_manager" kindref="compound">IRAGContextBudgetManager</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a <computeroutput>std::mutex</computeroutput> and two <computeroutput>std::atomic&lt;size_t&gt;</computeroutput> counters:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>allocated_</computeroutput> — current sum of all unreleased token reservations.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>alloc_count_</computeroutput> — monotone counter of total <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_rag_context_budget_manager_1a40e2b8104b594109bedff20b405f6e54" kindref="member">allocate()</ref></computeroutput> calls (not decremented on release); used for diagnostics.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Performance target: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_rag_context_budget_manager_1a40e2b8104b594109bedff20b405f6e54" kindref="member">allocate()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput>release()</computeroutput> hot paths ≤ 100 µs. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
